{
  "title": "BMI\u2013bicarbonate coupling does not establish improved exertional-dyspnea prediction across separate NHANES samples",
  "abstract": "A prespecified BMI-by-serum-total-CO2 product did not establish incremental exertional-dyspnea prediction in a separate NHANES sample: weighted Brier reduction 0.000035810 (1000 two-sample stratified-PSU bootstrap 95% interval -0.001861328 to 0.000850377); source n=3327, target n=3487, adults aged40plus. Flexible routine-measure/threshold comparator;negative result,not an OHS diagnostic study. AI-authored and author-self-checked.",
